# Everything the signed-release build drops into app/release/, whatever it decides
# to drop next: mapping.txt (the R8 deobfuscation map - not something to publish),
# native-debug-symbols.zip, the APKs and the .dm sidecars. output-metadata.json is
# the one file there that is tracked on purpose, so it is named back in.
app/release/*
!app/release/output-metadata.json
